#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:36
#: 1be2622e145545cbb7a96d47c04b93e3
msgid "Day 1: First Motion in Simulation"
msgstr "第 1 天：仿真中的首次运动"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:38
#: a5d94b4c70be4ce7affa6ebdb7abb6f0
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Install the environment, then run a robot demo (`hardware` "
"default `mock_components`)."
msgstr "**目标：** 先安装环境，再运行机器人演示（`hardware` 默认为 `mock_components`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:41
#: 97a8115f4ea24f1d9c5db06d0a7ea131
msgid ""
"[Install Environment](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — "
"Ubuntu 24.04, ROS 2 Jazzy + rosdep. On a bare host: add the ROS apt "
"source, then `ros-jazzy-desktop` / `ros-dev-tools` (fishros is optional)."
" Workspace entry is `./init_repo.sh`, then `source install/setup.bash`."
msgstr ""
"[环境安装](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — Ubuntu 24.04、ROS "
"2 Jazzy + rosdep。裸机上：先加 ROS apt 源，再装 `ros-jazzy-desktop` / `ros-dev-"
"tools`（fishros 可选）。工作区入口是 `./init_repo.sh`，然后 `source "
"install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:42
#: 0fbdcc431cf34561ab7003065e22d44c
msgid "Clone `open-deploy-ws` and run the official init script:"
msgstr "克隆 `open-deploy-ws` 并运行官方初始化脚本："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:43
#: 6df2029030cc4fd485a43aca43f18192
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:48
#: 474278a838cd46bfa6dfc651842ae223
msgid "Build the workspace:"
msgstr "编译工作空间："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:49
#: 82f519142e514db180c44179ac15d7cc
msgid "colcon build --symlink-install\n"
msgstr "colcon build --symlink-install\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:52
#: 0d6f3384c6cb40efac1ccd8cdc289f6d
msgid ""
"Launch the demo (defaults: `robot:=cr5`, `hardware:=mock_components` — "
"omit both; there is no `hardware:=mock`):"
msgstr ""
"启动演示（默认：`robot:=cr5`、`hardware:=mock_components` — 两者都可省略；没有 "
"`hardware:=mock`）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:53
#: d7f8d76b2a314777841b0d8cbe333edf
msgid ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py\n"
msgstr ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:58
#: 04b909f6ef9f44edabe227022ebe7a39
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [open-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/open-deploy-ws), [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [open-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws)、[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:60
#: b46c1774372241dbb02bb0c538f7b00f
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** RViz opens with the OCS2 demo; FSM starts in HOLD. See "
"[Quick Demo](../1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md)."
msgstr ""
"**结果：** RViz 打开 OCS2 演示；FSM 从 HOLD 开始。见 "
"[快速演示](../1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:62
#: 3c340d9de3d54ded93f3c64277942374
msgid "Day 2: Switch Robots"
msgstr "第 2 天：切换机器人"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:64
#: 4b72e6ef17c94536b83633c705f3fae4
msgid "**Goal:** Change the robot model and understand the description system."
msgstr "**目标：** 更换机器人模型，并理解描述系统。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:67
#: a0d02a62701b48e6b8f28bb5a4a6892b
msgid ""
"Use the `arx-lift2s` branch of `open-deploy-ws` for this robot, not the "
"Day 1 default tree. Clone and `./init_repo.sh` are on [ARX Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md). Prefer "
"`./init_repo.sh` so nested modules under `src/robot-descriptions/` match "
"`submodules_visibility.conf` (do not recursive-init)."
msgstr ""
"这台机器人用 `open-deploy-ws` 的 `arx-lift2s` 分支，而不是第 1 天的默认仓库树。克隆和 `./init_repo.sh` 见 [方舟无限 Lift 2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)。优先用 `./init_repo.sh`，让 `src/robot-descriptions/` 下的嵌套模块与 `submodules_visibility.conf` 一致（不要递归 init）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:68
#: de1712a77b4d48c8a6cf7553e2d7501b
msgid "Rebuild the packages you need, then `source install/setup.bash`."
msgstr "重建所需软件包，然后 `source install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:69
#: e47541b30b964e1f9637c89fcbceabcb
msgid "Launch the new robot (omit `hardware:=`; the launch default is `mock_components`):"
msgstr "用新机器人启动（省略 `hardware:=`；启动默认是 `mock_components`）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:70
#: 341ef2307b284de9bd0b60d449c7f61f
msgid "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
msgstr "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:73
#: a5be7239184d4f47963445b8ad9c64fb
msgid ""
"`arx_lift2s` is **ARX Lift 2S** (方舟无限), the full-body mobile manipulator "
"(arms, lift, and chassis). It is not **Acone** / **AC One** (`arx_acone`, "
"dual-arm). `full_body.launch.py` starts `ocs2_wbc_controller`, which ships "
"in the `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` deb."
msgstr ""
"`arx_lift2s` 是 **方舟无限 Lift 2S**，全身移动操作臂（手臂、升降轴和底盘）。它不是 **Acone** / **AC One**（`arx_acone`，双臂）。`full_body.launch.py` 会启动 `ocs2_wbc_controller`，该控制器已包含在 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 这个 deb 里。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:75
#: 6b2a31deb5a640dabec15053f4c9e34f
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions), brand-specific READMEs"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions)、各品牌 README"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:77
#: 617b97f80ba94f13bcc9956df572dd43
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** You have switched from the Day 1 CR5 `demo.launch.py` to ARX "
"Lift 2S on `full_body.launch.py`."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 你已从第 1 天的 CR5 `demo.launch.py`，切换到方舟无限 Lift 2S 的 `full_body.launch.py`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:79
#: 6cd786c4230a46be9850d2d5643e90e9
msgid "Day 3: Gazebo and Isaac Simulation"
msgstr "第 3 天：Gazebo 与 Isaac 仿真"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:81
#: 9cad3450ec3642fd86abf1e899b983bc
msgid "**Goal:** Run physics simulation instead of mock hardware."
msgstr "**目标：** 运行物理仿真，而不是 mock 硬件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:83
#: a518cc724c944bf5a348e862248260a1
msgid "Gazebo Harmonic"
msgstr "Gazebo Harmonic"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:85
#: 223163474d4f4e2381a681b6e0f63868
msgid ""
"# Install Gazebo packages (if not already)\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Gazebo\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"
msgstr ""
"# Install Gazebo packages (if not already)\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Gazebo\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:93
#: 9bbbb88166a64dd587ba7ca4bf5c0668
msgid "Isaac Sim (FaSim)"
msgstr "Isaac Sim（FaSim）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:95
#: 57054223bb7a450fa5b04ddd27a117ee
msgid ""
"**FaSim** pairs NVIDIA Isaac Sim with the same ROS 2 运控 stack as the real"
" robot. Follow [Isaac Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md): "
"clone [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac), run "
"`./init.sh`, then `./run.sh`, and connect with **one** of the two paths "
"on that page (`hardware:=isaac`, or Play on a `ROS2ControlLaunch` "
"payload). Default Isaac path is `ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim`); override "
"in `config/fa_sim.local.conf`."
msgstr "**FaSim** 把 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 和真机同一套 ROS 2 运控配在一起。按 [Isaac Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md) 做：克隆 [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac)，跑 `./init.sh`，再 `./run.sh`，并只用那一页上的**一条**接入路径（`hardware:=isaac`，或在带 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 的 payload 上按 Play）。Isaac 默认路径是 `ISAACSIM_DIR`（`~/isaacsim`）；在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 里覆盖。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:97
#: 5f167987f525446f99d3fb45cb37cdb7
msgid ""
"What the two connections and the Kit extensions do: [FaSim-"
"Isaac](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md). Assets: "
"[robot_usds](../4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md), [Environment "
"assets](../4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md)."
msgstr "两种接入方式和 Kit 扩展做什么，见 [FaSim-Isaac](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)。资产见 [robot_usds](../4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md)、[环境资产](../4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:99
#: cb00e175288e4699979626ffbbe3230d
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac), [robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac)、[robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:101
#: d9553af5ece4466d9e3d834b01a6c49c
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** Physics-based simulation with Gazebo, or FaSim (Isaac + ROS "
"2 运控, matching real-robot motion plus ground truth)."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 基于物理的仿真，可用 Gazebo，或 FaSim（Isaac + ROS 2 运控，运动对齐真机并带仿真真值）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:103
#: bda0b4aff48b4bcc80a0cc3b1106fee7
msgid "Day 4: Python Interface"
msgstr "第 4 天：Python 接口"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:105
#: d889755ee9b94090a71a14c84b275820
msgid "**Goal:** Control the robot programmatically."
msgstr "**目标：** 以编程方式控制机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:108
#: 03a9e9857fb349d7bb2ff1d146dc76b1
msgid "Install fa-py-libraries:"
msgstr "安装 fa-py-libraries："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:109
#: 1f4dec5a40f240baa8b2354ae2852106
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all    # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2_robot_interface and "
"related submodules\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all    # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2_robot_interface and "
"related submodules\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:115
#: e2c99ac6b33d4bc6a2daebc9f88c667e
msgid "Write a simple script:"
msgstr "编写一个简单脚本："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:116
#: 797feaecbb15448ead3783ab56fa4a68
msgid ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import ROS2RobotInterface, "
"ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig\n"
"\n"
"interface = ROS2RobotInterface(ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig())\n"
"interface.connect()\n"
"joint_state = interface.get_joint_state()\n"
"pose = interface.left_arm_handler.get_pose()\n"
msgstr ""
