#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:198
#: 630fc4b49264469684b2c34f68d5b5a8
msgid ""
"**Safety:** Prove the motion in `mock_components`, or in the sim path "
"that workspace documents, before you set `hardware:=real`."
msgstr "**安全：** 先在 `mock_components`，或该工作区文档里的仿真路径上把动作跑通，再设 `hardware:=real`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:201
#: e97851d04b7c43fd82df3ccaa4232e3d
msgid "Day 7: Bring one new robot into FaSim"
msgstr "第 7 天：把一台新机器人接入 FaSim"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:203
#: c264ab31d6a34a51972c7f742a02169d
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Independently connect a robot that is not already a demo, so "
"Isaac and the ROS 2 stack move it. This is the exam, not a walkthrough of"
" CR5 or W2. You are done when a command moves that robot in the viewport "
"and you can hand in the items below."
msgstr "**目标：** 独立接上一台还不是现成 demo 的机器人，让 Isaac 和 ROS 2 运控把它动起来。这是考核，不是再走一遍 CR5 或 W2。一条指令能在视口里带动这台机器人，并且能交出下面这些材料，这一天就算完成。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:205
#: bfb7275595e548379bbc0b9102a27b08
msgid ""
"**Before you start.** Finish Days 0–3. You can reach HOLD with "
"`hardware:=mock_components`, Isaac Sim is installed, `ISAACSIM_DIR` is "
"set, and you have run FaSim `./init.sh` and `./run.sh`."
msgstr ""
"**开始之前。** 做完第 0 到第 3 天。你能用 `hardware:=mock_components` 进到 HOLD，Isaac Sim "
"已安装，`ISAACSIM_DIR` 已设置，并且跑过 FaSim 的 `./init.sh` 和 `./run.sh`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:207
#: 7c701488cbca46f2866df52b1d1432b5
msgid ""
"Package layout: [Add a "
"Robot](../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md). Start Sim and choose "
"a connection: [Isaac Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md). In-"
"process inputs, swerve chassis graphs, clock, and TF: [FaSim-"
"Isaac](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)."
msgstr "描述包怎么放：[添加机器人](../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md)。启动 Sim 并选择接入方式：[Isaac Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。进程内输入、舵轮底盘图、时钟和 TF：[FaSim-Isaac](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:209
#: 9bad7b2c52ea4cd6a15787b0a86ef7c6
msgid "Build these four pieces"
msgstr "准备这四样"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:211
#: 0300b6b7959349ce82002bec70d00d04
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**A description.** Add a `{robot}_description` package whose xacro "
"includes a `ros2_control` block. Simulation plugins come from "
"[`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)."
" Before you open Isaac, `ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py "
"robot:=<key>` reaches HOLD. Leave `hardware` at the default."
msgstr ""
"**描述包。** 增加 `{robot}_description`，xacro 里要有 `ros2_control` 块。仿真插件来自 "
"[`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)。打开"
" Isaac 之前，`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=<key>` "
"应能进到 HOLD。`hardware` 保持默认。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:213
#: 0b3af64d1be04f59a0d574c03950d02b
msgid ""
"**A USD stage.** `./run.sh` opens it, and the stage has one "
"ArticulationRoot for this robot. Put it under "
"[robot_usds](../4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md), or in a project "
"scene you can open. There is no `./run.sh --robot`."
msgstr "**一份 USD。** `./run.sh` 能打开它，舞台上这台机器人有一个 ArticulationRoot。放在 [robot_usds](../4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md) 下，或放进你能打开的项目场景。没有 `./run.sh --robot`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:215
#: 035af007510c4f3f95c67f41bd63e3a2
msgid ""
"**One connection for those joints.** Use the topic bridge *or* the in-"
"process graph, as in [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md). For `isaac_sim`, the xacro"
" must accept that hardware key, and the payload must contain "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` ([ROS 2 Control "
"extension](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#ros-2-control-"
"extension)). On a four-wheel swerve chassis such as Linkhou S2 or "
"Taku, the steer and drive joints are commanded by `SwerveController`, not"
" by that hardware key ([Swerve "
"extension](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#swerve-extension))."
msgstr "**给这些关节选一种接入。** 按 [Isaac Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)，用话题桥 *或* 进程内图。走 `isaac_sim` 时，xacro 必须接受这个硬件键，payload 里要有 `ROS2ControlLaunch`（[ROS 2 Control 扩展](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#ros-2-control-extension)）。像 Linkhou S2 或 Taku 这样的四轮舵轮底盘，转向关节和驱动关节由 `SwerveController` 指挥，而不是那个硬件键（[舵轮扩展](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#swerve-extension)）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:217
#: 55e3d6714a974f13836e5ec15abb2a1d
msgid ""
"**Controllers that match the body.** An arm, or a split-body robot, uses "
"`ocs2_arm_controller` (`demo` or `split_body`). A planner model that "
"includes the mobile base uses `full_body.launch.py` and "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`. That controller is already in the `ros-jazzy-arms-"
"ros2-control` deb from Day 6. Cloning [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) is how "
"you read or edit the source. Leave `infoFile` empty to keep the "
"description default. Lock a mobile base with the `mobile_base_tcp` info "
"file and `BASE_LOCK`. `full_body` together with a `fixed_base` info file "
"has no virtual chassis joint for that lock, and arm enable can stay in "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`."
msgstr ""
"**控制器跟身体对得上。** 机械臂或分体机器人用 `ocs2_arm_controller`（`demo` 或 "
"`split_body`）。规划模型里包含移动底盘时，用 `full_body.launch.py` 和 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。这个控制器已经在第六天的 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` deb 里。克隆"
" [ocs2-wbc-controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-"
"controller) 是为了读源码或改源码。`infoFile` 留空，就用描述包的默认 info。锁住移动底盘时用 "
"`mobile_base_tcp` 这份 info，并发送 `BASE_LOCK`。`full_body` 再配一份 `fixed_base` "
"info 时，没有这把锁能用的虚拟底盘关节，手臂使能会停在 `WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:219
#: 46c180ccee1444278a2030a929e2bd26
msgid "Work in this order"
msgstr "按这个顺序做"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:221
#: 8e869d719a214841862bc4779ae01761
msgid ""
"In mock, the launch above reaches HOLD, and the joint names match the "
"xacro."
msgstr "在 mock 里，上面的 launch 能进到 HOLD，关节名和 xacro 一致。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:222
#: acd57dd4cfbe4063b3f8b24e75e77534
msgid "Run `./run.sh`, open your USD, and press Play so physics runs."
msgstr "运行 `./run.sh`，打开你的 USD，按 Play，让物理开始跑。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:223
#: 558053e97fb64993afa8a40e937cf6e5
msgid ""
"Connect with the topic bridge or the in-process graph. Read the joint-"
"state topic with `ros2 topic echo`, or run `ros2 control "
"list_controllers`."
msgstr ""
"用话题桥或进程内的图接上。用 `ros2 topic echo` 看关节状态话题，或运行 `ros2 control "
"list_controllers`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:224
#: ed11a6cf08ee4ea28ae7417a083b9de2
msgid ""
"Send a small joint target. The same joints move in Isaac. On the in-"
"process graph, `ros2 topic hz /clock` follows the physics step."
msgstr "发一个小的关节目标。Isaac 里同一组关节会动。进程内的图上，`ros2 topic hz /clock` 跟着物理步走。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:226
#: 263dff6829d94be490fa15eda2bae050
msgid "What you hand in"
msgstr "要交什么"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:228
#: 42e184946c1842cd969091a38348a931
msgid "The description package, or the branch, and the USD path you opened."
msgstr "描述包或分支，以及你打开的 USD 路径。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:229
#: b896e80edb7f4588bef266d9bf2d93cc
msgid ""
"The launch line, or the `ROS2ControlLaunch` prim you played (and the "
"swerve graph, if you used one)."
msgstr "launch 命令，或你播放的那个 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 图元（如果用了舵轮图，也一并交上）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:230
#: c793ac6e13d049eaba030a244ee96679
msgid "The joint-state topic or the controller list, and the motion you sent."
msgstr "你看到的关节状态话题或控制器列表，以及你发出的动作。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:231
#: 66fa43851ee3428294cad48d4cc59a3c
msgid ""
"A short note of known limits, plus steps another person can replay, and a"
" demo recording."
msgstr "一份已知限制说明、别人能照着复现的步骤，以及演示录像。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:233
#: 94b58af88ccb44ea96617166a5a344c0
msgid "How you know it works"
msgstr "怎样算做完"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:235
#: 0f03b0eec9bb4aa99c5fa13f9a8b90ea
msgid ""
"Check the functions that belong to the robot you chose: joint control, "
"chassis motion, end effector, and sensor data. For a wheeled robot, show "
"that the base drives; for a robot with a dexterous hand, show that the "
"hand opens and closes."
msgstr "按你选的机器人检查相应功能：关节控制、底盘运动、末端执行器和传感器数据。轮式机器人要能看出底盘在走；带灵巧手的机器人要能看出手在开合。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:237
#: 40f9dcd58afe4e23b2357e71df5e52a5
msgid ""
"**Joints.** Mock reaches HOLD, Play runs, and the joint names in the "
"state topic or in `ros2 control list_controllers` match the xacro. A "
"command moves those joints in the viewport."
msgstr "**关节。** mock 能进到 HOLD，Play 在跑，状态话题或 `ros2 control list_controllers` 里的关节名和 xacro 一致。发一条指令后，视口里这些关节会动。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:239
#: d8fa06afe9a248a2a6d3b838fe6dc9d0
msgid ""
"**Base.** Follow the [TF](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md"
"#tf) and, if the robot drives on a map, "
"[Navigation](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#navigation)"
" sections. A ROS namespace does not rename `frame_id`. Composer "
"`ros2-stack` is a separate process on the host."
msgstr "**底盘。** 按 [TF](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#tf) 核对；如果机器人要在地图上行驶，再看 [导航](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#navigation)。ROS 命名空间不会改写 `frame_id`。Composer 的 `ros2-stack` 是主机上的另一个进程。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:241
#: cd33057b00514da28fbb10c296654a1a
msgid ""
"**End effector.** The launch arguments `type`, `left_type`, or "
"`right_type` name this gripper or hand, and you can see it open or close."
" There is no `gripper:=` argument."
msgstr ""
"**末端。** launch 参数 `type`、`left_type` 或 `right_type` 对上这只夹爪或手，能看见它张开或闭合。没有"
" `gripper:=` 参数。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:243
#: 40460cba88c74c9791a7a7b353dade65
msgid ""
"**Sensors.** While Play is running, the camera or lidar topics from the "
"scene are publishing. Camera rigs stay on the scene USD."
msgstr "**传感器。** Play 期间，场景里的相机或雷达话题在发数据。相机装在场景 USD 上。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:245
#: b93533a34fa34536b4bd1f71aa77058b
msgid ""
"If a timed motion finishes much too fast, check `/clock` against "
"[Clock](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#clock) before "
"you edit joint gains."
msgstr "如果带时限的动作结束得过快，先按 [时钟](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#clock) 检查 `/clock`，再去改关节增益。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:247
#: 301ac443dedb49048d5e1a0ef6a04fd9
msgid "Optional: Synthetic data (Isaac)"
msgstr "可选：合成数据（Isaac）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:249
#: 7457b2218c9042b9a303b3e2cc384682
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Understand the Isaac datagen path (not Gazebo): USD scene → "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` → composer `task_queue` → LeRobot dataset on disk."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 弄清 Isaac 数据采集路径（不是 Gazebo）：USD 场景 → `ROS2RobotInterface` → "
"composer `task_queue` → 磁盘上的 LeRobot 数据集。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:251
#: 5de2eff51f4f4fd5a842826287cb5694
msgid ""
"Follow [Synthetic Data](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md) on "
"[lerobot_ros2](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2) `main` and "
"[robot_action_composer](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer) `main`. Stop at recording/export; skip "
"training."
msgstr ""
"按 [合成数据](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md) 走 "
"[lerobot_ros2](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2) 的 `main` 和 "
"[robot_action_composer](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer) 的 `main`。停在录制 / 导出，跳过训练。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:253
#: c6ddb62fbff14916b0c0f060841985f7
msgid "After the beginner path"
msgstr "新手路径之后"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:255
#: 0efb5310daf641d5a2ce1c3167be88a5
msgid ""
"Continue by **role** in [More "
"applications](../6-more_applications/0-index.md): field commissioning "
"(现场调试), classical algorithm (传统方案算法工程师), VLA collect / train / deploy "
"(VLA 采训推), simulation (仿真工程师)."
msgstr ""
"按 **角色** 继续看[更多应用](../6-more_applications/0-index.md)：现场调试、传统方案算法工程师、VLA "
"采训推、仿真工程师。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:257
#: 7fae7d8b285e43248b5285f9adae643a
msgid "Tips for Success"
msgstr "实用建议"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:259
#: fb45d4ac7a154a28bcc82c4e79cc4e3d
msgid ""
"**Don't skip mock mode** — Always verify behavior in mock before "
"simulation or real hardware"
msgstr "**不要跳过 mock 模式** — 在进入仿真或真实硬件之前，务必先在 mock 中验证行为"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:260
#: 6fc4367ec615404995d1bbca39986055
msgid ""
"**Read the warnings** — The stack logs helpful messages about "
"configuration issues"
msgstr "**阅读警告信息** — 技术栈会记录有助于排查配置问题的日志"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:261
#: bb322d6a80a84ba4a55932c47223ede3
msgid ""
"**Use lean branches** — `open-deploy-ws` offers `dobot-cr5`, `arx-"
"lift2s`, and `panthera-ht`"
msgstr "**使用精简分支** — `open-deploy-ws` 提供 `dobot-cr5`、`arx-lift2s` 和 `panthera-ht`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:262
#: 949729e120bc46268940c7ed3d4fac7a
msgid ""
"**Ask questions** — File issues on the relevant repository for bugs or "
"unclear documentation"
msgstr "**提出问题** — 遇到缺陷或文档不清时，请在相应仓库提交 issue"

