#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Base.** Isaac publishes `world → odom"
#~ " → base_*`. `robot_state_publisher` publishes "
#~ "the URDF tree, including `base_footprint "
#~ "→ base_link` when both links exist. "
#~ "OCS2 `baseFrame` is that same link. "
#~ "One node publishes each TF edge. A"
#~ " ROS namespace does not rename "
#~ "`frame_id`. A base that drives on "
#~ "a map uses `NavigationLaunch` on the "
#~ "USD. `map` is a path relative to"
#~ " the opened `env/` layer, and the "
#~ "node starts `navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`. "
#~ "Composer `ros2-stack` is a separate "
#~ "process on the host."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**底盘。** Isaac 发布 `world → odom →"
#~ " base_*`。`robot_state_publisher` 发布 URDF "
#~ "树；两根连杆都在时，其中包含 `base_footprint → base_link`。OCS2 "
#~ "的 `baseFrame` 就是这根连杆。一条 TF 边只由一个节点发布。ROS "
#~ "命名空间不会改 `frame_id`。底盘要在地图上走时，USD 上放 "
#~ "`NavigationLaunch`。`map` 是相对已打开 `env/` 层的路径，节点启动的是"
#~ " `navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`。composer 的 "
#~ "`ros2-stack` 是主机上的另一个进程。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**A second robot on the same "
#~ "stage.** Each ArticulationRoot has its "
#~ "own graph and its own "
#~ "`ROS2ControlLaunch` `namespace`. Topics live "
#~ "under `/<ns>/`. Frame names stay "
#~ "`world`, `odom`, and `base_link`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**同一场景里的第二台机器人。** 每个 ArticulationRoot 有自己的图，也有自己的"
#~ " `ROS2ControlLaunch` `namespace`。话题在 `/<ns>/` "
#~ "下。坐标系名仍是 `world`、`odom` 和 `base_link`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A motion that finishes much too "
#~ "fast is a `/clock` problem. The "
#~ "in-process W2 payload takes the clock"
#~ " from the physics step. The topic-"
#~ "bridge payload still takes it from "
#~ "the playback tick. The [FaSim "
#~ "reference](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md) describes"
#~ " that clock. Changing joint gains "
#~ "does not fix it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "动作结束得特别快，是 `/clock` 的问题。进程内的 W2 "
#~ "载荷从物理步取时钟。话题桥载荷仍从播放节拍取时钟。[FaSim "
#~ "参考](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md) 写了这个时钟。改关节增益修不好。"

